The on-phone capture service that Luma downloads and runs is scrcpy-server,
from the scrcpy project:

  Copyright (C) 2018-2026 Romain Vimont and contributors
  https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

A copy of that license is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/scrcpy-Apache-2.0.txt.

Luma also downloads, on first launch or inside the Windows zip:

  Android SDK Platform-Tools (adb), from Google
  FFmpeg LGPL build, used only as a separate decoder program

Those tools stay separate programs. Luma does not link them into Luma.exe.
